course: dictionary
lesson: 12874
title: Enrolment: joining and counting
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Enrolment means joining a school, course or club by putting your name on the list. «Enrolment day is on Monday, so bring your birth certificate.» You sign up on enrolment day. That is what the word means here.
explain: Enrolment can also be a number. «The school's enrolment this year is 420 pupils.» Here it means how many people have joined, not the act of joining. Ask yourself: is the sentence about a person signing up, or about how many are signed up?
explain: Look for clues around the word. Words like form, day, open and numbers often show that enrolment means signing up or counting. Use the swap test: put "joining" in place of enrolment. If the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: Enrolment means putting your name on a list to join a school, course or club.
fact: Enrolment can also mean the number of people who have joined.
fact: Useful phrases: enrolment form, school enrolment, open for enrolment.
fact: UK, Australian, New Zealand and Irish spelling is enrolment; the US spelling is enrollment.
fact: In maths problems you may compare enrolment between years, add up totals, or work out percentages.
exercise: «Enrolment day is on Monday.» What does enrolment mean here? | A holiday from school | *Joining the school by signing up | A test for every class | Lunch in the hall
exercise: «The school's enrolment this year is 420 pupils.» What does enrolment mean here? | The name of the head teacher | *The number of pupils who have joined | The date of the summer fair | A kind of school bag
exercise: Year 4 enrolment is 60 pupils and Year 5 enrolment is 75 pupils. How many more pupils are in Year 5? | 135 | 5 | *15 | 25
test: «Fill in the enrolment form before Friday.» What is an enrolment form? | A letter from the library | A list of lunch choices | A form for asking about the weather | *A form you fill in to join the school
test: «The club is open for enrolment, so put your name down.» What does open for enrolment mean? | *The club is taking new members who want to sign up | The club has closed for the year | Only members from last year can come | The club door is open and the lights are on
exam: Which spelling is used in the UK and Australia for joining a school or course? | *enrolment | enrolemnt | enrollmnt | enrollment
